    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stepping out of the frame\" ... that sounds almost peaceful. like, instead of struggling to keep my head above water in a storm that's never going to end, i could just let go. if the world is just a spectacle of destruction, is there really any moral obligation to stay and watch it?",
